apps/client/src-tauri/gen

dist
build/Output
coverage

*.log*
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea
.vscode
.fleet

.env
.env.*
!.env.example

.github
